<wpt lat="38.544395" lon="-106.926935"><name>Coffee: Gunnison</name><desc>Mile 0. Gunnison Coffee Company, 910 W New York, 6 to 6 (weekends 7 to 5); The Coffee Trader, 700 N Main, 970-707-4284. Map data, not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.552915" lon="-106.926896"><name>Fuel: City Market. 106 MILES TO LEADVILLE</name><desc>Mile 0.6. Buena Vista is 2.6 mi off at mile 75.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.723545" lon="-106.775895"><name>Way out: Left onto Spring Creek Road</name><desc>Mile 17.1. Wet? Stay on Taylor River Road: 19 mi, paved, to the same place.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.855879" lon="-106.707827"><name>Rough: Onto Rocky Brook Road</name><desc>Mile 28.1.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="38.840712" lon="-106.556686"><name>Way out: Cottonwood Pass Road</name><desc>Mile 45.7. Closed? No short way: US 50 and Monarch, 90 mi from Gunnison to Buena Vista.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.223687" lon="-106.347751"><name>Fuel: Shell, Leadville</name><desc>Mile 106.3.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.247289" lon="-106.291357"><name>Lunch: Leadville</name><desc>Mile 110. Tennessee Pass Cafe, 222 Harrison, from 11, 719-486-8101; High Mountain Pies, 115 W 4th, pizza, from 11, 719-486-5555. Coffee: City on a Hill, Harrison Ave. Listings, not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.504991" lon="-106.142155"><name>Fuel: Copper</name><desc>Mile 133.4.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="39.575425" lon="-106.111395"><name>Coffee: Frisco, Main Street</name><desc>Mile 139.2. Rocky Mountain Coffee Roasters, 285 E Main; Butterhorn, 408 E Main, to 2:30.</desc></wpt>
